        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And behold, he was never heard of more among the Nephites; and thus were the affairs of the people.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 16:8",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And thus ended the eighty and sixth year of the reign of the judges over the people of Nephi.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 16:9",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And thus ended also the eighty and seventh year of the reign of the judges, the more part of the people remaining in their pride and wickedness, and the lesser part walking more circumspectly before God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 16:10",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And these were the conditions also, in the eighty and eighth year of the reign of the judges.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 16:11",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And there was but little alteration in the affairs of the people, save it were the people began to be more hardened in iniquity, and do more and more of that which was contrary to the commandments of God, in the eighty and ninth year of the reign of the judges.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 168,
            "end": 176,
            "text": "TG Disobedience."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Disobedience.",
            "prettyString": "TG Disobedience",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
