        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Helaman 16:12",
        "book": "Helaman",
        "chapter": 16,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "But it came to pass in the ninetieth year of the reign of the judges, there were great signs given unto the people, and wonders; and the words of the prophets began to be fulfilled.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "3 Ne. 1:4."
          },
          {
            "start": 159,
            "end": 164,
